      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk pointed a sharp claw toward the door, his eyes narrowing. Lina reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season, setting it on the step between them as a gesture of peace. The fox stared at the bright fruit for a long moment, the silence stretching between them. Finally, he straightened his vest and stepped onto the first stair, silently gesturing for her to follow."
    }
